      "content": "$$\\int_{\\mathrm{P}}^{\\mathrm{Q}} (-m_0 c - e \\varphi_i u^i) ds = \\int_{\\mathrm{P}}^{\\mathrm{Q}} (-m_0 c u_i - e \\varphi_i) u^i ds$$",
