      "content": "$$\\delta \\int_{\\mathrm{P}}^{\\mathrm{Q}} (J_1 dx^1 + J_2 dx^2 + J_3 dx^3 + J_4 dx^4) = \\delta \\int_{\\mathrm{P}}^{\\mathrm{Q}} J_i dx^i = 0.$$",
