      "content": "$$\\delta \\int_{t_1}^{t_2} [-m_0 c^2 \\sqrt{1 - \\beta^2} - e c \\varphi_4 - e(\\varphi_1 v_x + \\varphi_2 v_y + \\varphi_3 v_z)] dt = 0$$",
